title CLI Analysis Flow (askslm.py + cli.py)

participant Engineer
participant EntryPoint as askslm.py
participant Parser as cli.build_parser
participant Command as cmd_*
participant Loader as _load_and_enrich
participant Inputs
participant Configs
participant Processor as SRAProcessor
participant Analysis
participant Output

Engineer->EntryPoint: python askslm.py <command> --view <view> ...
EntryPoint->Parser: Parse args and dispatch args.func
Parser->Command: Execute selected command handler

Command->Loader: _load_and_enrich(view, inputs_dir, config_dir)
Loader->Inputs: Load metadata.csv and taxonomy.csv
Loader->Configs: For each project, check <project>.json
Loader->Processor: Apply mapping when config exists
Loader->Command: Return taxonomy_df and enriched_metadata_df

Command->Analysis: Run compute function for selected command
Analysis->Command: Return result DataFrame(s)
Command->Output: Write CSV/HTML outputs under results/<view>/<analysis>/
Command->Engineer: Print summary and output paths